----------------------------------------
CHAPTER 3
SOURCE CODE FREEDOM
----------------------------------------

Article 8.
Source code shall remain publicly accessible when
redistributed.

Article 9.
No distributor may deliberately conceal modifications.

Article 10.
All modifications shall be documented.

